OL,3,GNEWSAArchive will preserve stories of
OL,4,Ablack US airmen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA research project exploring untold
OL,7,Fstories of black US Air Force personnel
OL,8,Fbased in East Anglia during the Cold
OL,9,FWar has the potential to become one of
OL,10,Fthe first and biggest archives of its
OL,11,Fkind, its project manager hopes.
OL,13,FBlack USAF: Cultural Connections in
OL,14,FCold War East Anglia, led by Elma
OL,15,FGlasgow from Cambridgeshire, was
OL,16,Flaunched last year and includes
OL,17,Ffirst-hand recollections from people
OL,18,Facross the region.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
