OL,3,GNEWSAArchive will preserve stories of
OL,4,Ablack US airmen
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhase one, which saw various stories
OL,7,Fcollected by the project team, has been
OL,8,Fcompleted and the team is hoping to
OL,9,Fexpand it further.
OL,11,FGlasgow said eventually she hoped it
OL,12,Fwould become the first and largest
OL,13,Farchive for these stories "ever
OL,14,Fcaptured in one place in the entire
OL,15,Fcountry".
